WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.130
<b>Why?</b>

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.460
<b>Who? Who did this?</b>

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:11.630
<b>I did it.</b>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.220
<b>I've found you.</b>

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:15.930
<b>You bastard!</b>

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:17.930
<b>How could you do that to my friends?</b>

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:22.930
<b>You're the ones
who killed our dad that Christmas night!</b>

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:26.440
<b>What did you say?</b>

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:29.610
<b>I'm saying that you're the one
who killed him,</b>

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:31.860
<b>Chocolove McDonnell.</b>

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:34.490
<b>We will avenge him!</b>

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:45.000
Unyielding wish that rises in my chest

