<b><i><i>At any rate, right now, these two</i></i></b>

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:18.530
<b><i><i>are out for revenge against me!</i></i></b>

00:03:22.530 --> 00:03:24.530
<b><i><i>You get what you give, huh?</i></i></b>

00:03:25.030 --> 00:03:26.450
<b><i><i>That may well be,</i></i></b>

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:29.870
<b><i><i>but you killed my friends too!</i></i></b>

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:33.330
<b>Shaft!</b>

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:37.380
<b><i>Sorry, kid.</i></b>

00:03:38.210 --> 00:03:41.380
<b><i>It's true.
I did kill someone three years back.</i></b>

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:45.300
<b><i><i>And I'm sure it's true
that he was your old man.</i></i></b>

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:50.600
<b><i><i>But if I'm going to make a world
with only laughter and no fighting,</i></i></b>

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:52.690
<b><i><i>then I can't die just yet!</i></i></b>

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:57.480
<b><i><i>That's why I swore
I'd never kill anyone ever again.</i></i></b>

00:03:59.190 --> 00:04:00.400
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:01.690
<b>I'm…</b>

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:03.400
<b>truly sorry!</b>

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:10.910
<b>Do you think apologizing</b>

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:14.330
<b>would satisfy me and Seyram?</b>

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:18.170
<b>Do you think the Golem
could be destroyed by the likes of you?</b>

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:22.510
<b>Their intermediary is… regenerating!</b>

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:27.140
<b>Of course not.</b>

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:29.600
<b>How could this be settled so easily?</b>

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:32.060
<b>It's okay, Mic.</b>

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:34.020
<b>If there's anyone</b>

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:38.980
<b>I'm not worthy of making laugh,
it's these two.</b>

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:44.820
<b>It's tricky, you know… Getting laughs.</b>

00:04:50.030 --> 00:04:52.290
<b>Boss, I'll take Chocolove.</b>

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:57.710
<b>You are Mickey's son, Asakura Yoh, right?</b>

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:01.590
<b>If this means
you're a friend of his, I'll kill you too.</b>

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:05.630
<b>If you're ready to do that, then do it.</b>

00:05:06.220 --> 00:05:09.390
<b>I'm sorry, is the murderer's friend
preaching to me?</b>

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:11.890
<b>You murdered Chocolove.</b>

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:14.390
<b>No! That was justice.</b>

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:16.560
<b>We just got our vengeance!</b>

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:19.060
<b>Did it make you feel better?</b>

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:22.610
<b>You've got your vengeance.</b>

00:05:23.190 --> 00:05:26.070
<b>But do you two feel any different?</b>

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:33.950
<b>Seyram's mind…</b>

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:36.290
<b>still hasn't returned!</b>

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:42.300
<b>It's you!</b>

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:45.420
<b>Our vengeance isn't complete
because you showed up!</b>

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:52.390
<b>Die!</b>

00:05:57.440 --> 00:05:58.440
<b>I guess you won't mind</b>

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:03.520
<b>if I fight to get vengeance
for Chocolove, will you?</b>

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:05.570
<b>Vengeance?</b>

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:08.490
<b>You've never lost anything dear to you!</b>

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:10.450
<b>You just say empty words!</b>

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:12.950
<b>As if you're so enlightened!</b>

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:16.700
<b>Maybe so.</b>

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:18.960
<b>But that's not all.</b>

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:20.210
<b>What?</b>

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:24.960
<b>You can still go back.</b>

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:30.340
<b><i>Yoh is nowhere near a match
for a Golem right now.</i></b>

00:06:30.430 --> 00:06:32.510
<b>So why aren't we hurrying over there?</b>

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:33.970
<b>As long as he doesn't die.</b>

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:36.100
<b>However strong his opponent is,</b>

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:38.850
<b>Yoh doesn't get into fights
that might kill him.</b>

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:41.730
<b>He just needs to lose</b>

00:06:41.810 --> 00:06:43.480
<b>and then come back around again.</b>

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:45.480
<b>Around again?</b>

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:49.860
<b>I'm counting on you
to stop Chocolove's bleeding, Tokageroh.</b>

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:55.240
<b>Are you planning on getting
those X-guys again to revive him?</b>

00:06:55.830 --> 00:06:59.040
<b>Now that Yoh's out of the Shaman Fight,</b>

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:01.120
<b>they have no incentive to deal with us.</b>

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:03.540
<b>So what, then?</b>

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:05.800
<b>Back then…</b>

00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:08.260
<b><i>I was really dead.</i></b>

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:10.340
<b>I know.</b>

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:12.300
<b>They did it, right?</b>

00:07:13.510 --> 00:07:15.010
<b><i>Gandhara have the power</i></b>

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:17.390
<b><i>to wake the dead.</i></b>

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:19.560
<b>All the same…</b>

00:07:20.270 --> 00:07:21.640
<b>Tokageroh.</b>

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:23.940
<b>No matter what,</b>

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:26.270
<b>we have to find Gandhara.</b>

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:30.030
<b>Let's save our tears until
that doesn't work out.</b>

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:34.160
<b>What's this?</b>

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:36.450
<b>We have no choice now, then.</b>

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:38.740
<b>Let's do this.</b>

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:40.500
<b>We'll show you</b>

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:43.580
<b>the true power of the Golem!</b>

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:45.710
<b>Amida-Style…</b>

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:50.760
<b>Giant Halo Blade!</b>

00:07:57.680 --> 00:07:59.390
<b>Amazing!</b>

00:08:00.020 --> 00:08:01.810
<b>Not even I knew</b>

00:08:01.890 --> 00:08:03.940
<b>that this was the Golem's true power!</b>

00:08:05.690 --> 00:08:07.360
<b>What a surge of Furyoku…</b>

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:09.730
<b>Shall we go again?</b>

00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:09.730
<b>Of course!</b>

00:08:10.230 --> 00:08:15.110
<b><i>He fires beams in a radius,
yet their course is straight and true!</i></b>

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:19.120
<b>As long as we keep our eyes on him,
we can see exactly where they're going!</b>

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:21.950
<b>I will get revenge</b>

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:24.170
<b>and make Seyram her old self again!</b>

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:26.750
<b>Sephirot Blast!</b>

00:08:32.550 --> 00:08:33.380
<b>Seyram!</b>

00:08:35.260 --> 00:08:37.800
<b><i>Keter, netzach, tiferet.</i></b>

00:08:37.890 --> 00:08:39.510
<b>Fly, Golem!</b>

00:08:41.430 --> 00:08:42.560
<b>This is dangerous!</b>

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:46.230
<b>If they attack from above,
we have no way to evade it!</b>

00:08:46.310 --> 00:08:47.270
<b>Right.</b>

00:08:54.110 --> 00:08:55.780
<b>Way to go, Golem! Look!</b>

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:59.530
<b>Awesome! There's no trace of them left!</b>

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:00.790
<b>No trace!</b>

00:09:02.370 --> 00:09:03.450
<b>What the…</b>

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:05.120
<b>If below's no good, go above.</b>

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:10.420
<b>You get what you give.</b>

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:13.670
<b>Golem!</b>

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:15.380
<b>Eye Beam!</b>

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:24.060
<b>No more tricks up your sleeve?
I don't think you can regenerate anymore.</b>

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:25.770
<b>"Regenerate"?</b>

00:09:26.270 --> 00:09:28.150
<b>How did you know about that?</b>

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:29.980
<b>He told me.</b>

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:34.820
<b>Mic, Chocolove's Spirit Ally.</b>

00:09:36.070 --> 00:09:41.530
<b>I'm sure he'd like nothing more
than to chew you to pieces right now.</b>

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:45.540
<b>And I wouldn't object
to giving him the body to do it with.</b>

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:50.630
<b>Or I could slice this Golem in two
and send it hurtling to the ground.</b>

00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:54.130
<b>I don't mind falling from this height.</b>

00:09:54.710 --> 00:09:58.630
<b>Don't! That would mean Seyram dying too!</b>

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:00.640
<b>Okay?</b>

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:03.890
<b>You get what you give.</b>

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:08.020
<b>Don't you dare!</b>

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:11.480
<b>Then you should never have started
this pointless fight!</b>

00:10:13.110 --> 00:10:14.900
<b>When you fight with hatred,</b>

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:17.530
<b>you always lose something.</b>

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:19.990
<b>Both your peace of mind
and what you hold dear.</b>

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:24.620
<b>If you're fine
with a path of no return, then fight.</b>

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:28.580
<b>You've probably resolved yourself to that.</b>

00:10:32.380 --> 00:10:33.710
<b>Isn't this great?</b>

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:35.500
<b>If you killed me as well,</b>

00:10:36.170 --> 00:10:39.220
<b>you would have been killed
by someone even scarier!</b>

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:41.220
<b>Yoh…</b>

00:10:41.840 --> 00:10:45.720
<b>But I can't go back now!</b>

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:48.390
<b>I've already killed…</b>

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:49.560
<b>Hey!</b>

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:51.850
<b>Don't give up hope already!</b>

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:53.650
<b>Chocolove will be…</b>

00:10:56.730 --> 00:10:58.110
<b>What happened?</b>

00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:00.450
<b>The Golem…</b>

00:11:00.530 --> 00:11:02.240
<b>I don't know this side of him!</b>

00:11:02.990 --> 00:11:04.830
<b>Yoh…</b>

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:06.450
<b>You okay?</b>

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:07.790
<b>Yoh!</b>

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:09.040
<b>Redseb.</b>

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:10.620
<b>What the hell was that?</b>

00:11:10.710 --> 00:11:12.000
<b>I don't know!</b>

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:14.710
<b>I've never seen
the Golem like that before!</b>

00:11:15.290 --> 00:11:16.170
<b>Well,</b>

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:19.760
<b>I guess it was the Golem's true power
that you don't know about.</b>

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:22.370
<b>Amidamaru!</b>

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:23.390
<b>At your service!</b>

00:11:23.470 --> 00:11:25.300
<b>Spirit of Sword!</b>

00:11:32.560 --> 00:11:33.730
<b>Yoh!</b>

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:36.520
<b>Just get out of here, Redseb.</b>

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:39.110
<b>But Seyram is still there!</b>

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:41.200
<b>Losing your cool loses fights.</b>

00:11:41.280 --> 00:11:42.450
<b>Don't worry.</b>

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:45.740
<b>I promise I'll keep Seyram safe somehow.</b>

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:47.740
<b>Yoh…</b>

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:53.420
<b>Shem HaMephorash.</b>

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:10.890
<b>Where am I?</b>

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:14.060
<b>I think I've seen this on TV before.</b>

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:16.980
<b>It's Rodin's <i>The Gates of Hell.</i></b>

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:19.190
<b>That's it!</b>

00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:20.530
<b>I'm in hell!</b>

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:25.030
<b>Right. Of course I am,</b>

00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:27.830
<b>after all those people I killed.</b>

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:31.660
<b>But if you asked me,
I'd have said hell could never really be.</b>

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:36.250
<b>And if you axed me, I'd have said
these noodles are too al dente!</b>

00:12:36.830 --> 00:12:37.960
<b>Old Man?</b>

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:41.800
<b>It's been a while, Chocolove!</b>

00:12:42.300 --> 00:12:44.300
<b>No way! I can't believe it!</b>

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:47.340
<b>But that crappy joke proves it!</b>

00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:49.050
<b>It's you, Old Man Orona!</b>

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:52.020
<b>So you got sent to hell too?</b>

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:53.140
<b>Nincompoop!</b>

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:56.020
<b>I just followed you here!</b>

00:12:56.600 --> 00:12:59.360
<b>Anyway, what do you mean, Old Man?</b>

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:01.320
<b>You followed me…</b>

00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:03.440
<b>I'll explain later.</b>

00:13:03.530 --> 00:13:05.280
<b>First things first though.</b>

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:08.990
<b>This is hell.
But at the same time, it isn't.</b>

00:13:09.070 --> 00:13:12.450
<b>What? I don't really get what you mean.</b>

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:14.580
<b>I'm sure you don't.</b>

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:16.040
<b>Chocolove.</b>

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:19.170
<b>At the risk of stating the obvious,
only those that exist,</b>

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:20.630
<b>exist in this world.</b>

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:24.090
<b>And nothing is made by accident.</b>

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:28.140
<b><i>This world is inside the Great Spirit.</i></b>

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:30.930
<b>Come again</b>

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:30.930
<b>Ramen.</b>

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:33.390
<b><i>The Great Spirit…</i></b>

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:36.140
<b><i>The place every soul on earth
eventually returns to.</i></b>

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:41.320
<b><i>Indeed. And kindred spirits call out
to each other and are drawn together,</i></b>

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:44.990
<b><i>forming their own communes inside here.</i></b>

00:13:45.070 --> 00:13:47.360
<b><i>Animals have an animal community.</i></b>

00:13:47.450 --> 00:13:49.450
<b><i>Humans have a human community.</i></b>

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:52.910
<b><i>How it appears may vary according
to a soul's upbringing,</i></b>

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:56.120
<b><i>personal beliefs, and religion,</i></b>

00:13:56.210 --> 00:13:58.830
<b><i>but souls are in fact memories themselves.</i></b>

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:02.420
<b><i>In other words, the souls here
are a perfect reflection</i></b>

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:05.300
<b><i>of how they were in life.</i></b>

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:10.140
<b>Those who believe in a kingdom of light
go to a kingdom of light.</b>

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:13.680
<b>Those with darkness in their hearts
go to a world of darkness.</b>

00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:17.730
<b><i>That is, this commune called "hell."</i></b>

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:21.770
<b>So why don't they leave this place?</b>

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:25.530
<b>Humans are creatures particularly fond
of making black-and-white distinctions,</b>

00:14:25.610 --> 00:14:27.360
<b>such as with good and evil.</b>

00:14:27.440 --> 00:14:30.200
<b>Souls bound by their own concepts</b>

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:33.080
<b>cannot even see the outside world.</b>

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:35.790
<b>Follow me, Chocolove.</b>

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:40.750
<b><i>I will guide you
to the grandest soul of them all.</i></b>

00:14:43.380 --> 00:14:45.380
<b>Are you sure you're okay?</b>

00:14:46.050 --> 00:14:47.300
<b>This is nothing.</b>

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:49.720
<b>Just keep watch a little longer.</b>

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:51.680
<b>Be careful.</b>

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:52.430
<b>Right!</b>

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:58.180
<b><i><i>I'm hurt worse than I thought.</i></i></b>

00:14:58.680 --> 00:14:59.850
<b><i><i>What should I do?</i></i></b>

00:15:00.770 --> 00:15:01.650
<b>Master Yoh…</b>

00:15:02.310 --> 00:15:03.270
<b>Hey.</b>

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:07.570
<b>I wonder how Maiden revived Ren.</b>

00:15:07.650 --> 00:15:08.610
<b>What?</b>

00:15:08.690 --> 00:15:09.950
<b>I mean,</b>

00:15:10.530 --> 00:15:13.120
<b>people don't normally
just come back to life.</b>

00:15:14.450 --> 00:15:16.040
<b><i><i>Having your soul leave your body</i></i></b>

00:15:16.620 --> 00:15:18.040
<b><i><i>and seeing the next world</i></i></b>

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:19.960
<b><i><i>is no big deal for a Shaman.</i></i></b>

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:24.460
<b>But Ren and Ryu
both had their souls return</b>

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:27.090
<b>after their bodies had died.</b>

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:29.760
<b>Healing powers…</b>

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:32.970
<b>Master Yoh, are you…</b>

00:15:33.050 --> 00:15:34.760
<b>It's all down to thought power.</b>

00:15:35.760 --> 00:15:37.180
<b><i><i>The workings of the body…</i></i></b>

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:38.810
<b><i><i>The circulatory system…</i></i></b>

00:15:39.310 --> 00:15:42.690
<b><i><i>Visualizing each and every cell
and calling out to them…</i></i></b>

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:44.400
<b><i><i>Resurrecting them!</i></i></b>

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:47.730
<b>Let's give it a go.</b>

00:15:48.320 --> 00:15:50.400
<b>Let's try healing me with Over Soul!</b>

00:15:53.410 --> 00:15:55.570
<b>It's all gone so wrong.</b>

00:15:56.740 --> 00:15:59.580
<b>What exactly was our enemy?</b>

00:16:00.660 --> 00:16:04.250
<b><i>Why Dad build the Golem?</i></b>

00:16:05.250 --> 00:16:08.050
<b><i>What kind of person was our mom?</i></b>

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:14.930
<b>Furyoku response, 805…</b>

00:16:15.010 --> 00:16:17.010
<b>And the other one is 10,500.</b>

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:21.020
<b>Found you! The enemy of our people!</b>

00:16:26.110 --> 00:16:27.400
<b>Battle Mode!</b>

00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:31.030
<b>What?</b>

00:16:31.820 --> 00:16:34.740
<b>What an interesting find this is!</b>

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:39.620
<b>The Golem…</b>

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:43.080
<b>The sad symbol of a waning people.</b>

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:45.040
<b>This should be a real feast.</b>

00:16:46.210 --> 00:16:47.130
<b>Hao!</b>

00:16:47.210 --> 00:16:50.550
<b>Well, if it isn't Yoh!</b>

00:16:51.380 --> 00:16:53.300
<b>That's a nasty wound.</b>

00:16:53.380 --> 00:16:54.880
<b>Did this do it to you?</b>

00:16:55.380 --> 00:16:56.930
<b>Let the Golem go!</b>

00:16:57.010 --> 00:16:58.930
<b>Why are you here?</b>

00:16:59.010 --> 00:17:02.390
<b>Can't I go for a walk
with no particular destination?</b>

00:17:02.470 --> 00:17:04.100
<b>Who is that?</b>

00:17:04.180 --> 00:17:05.980
<b>He's got Seyram!</b>

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:06.980
<b>Stay back, Redseb!</b>

00:17:08.110 --> 00:17:09.310
<b>Run away!</b>

00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:10.900
<b>He's…</b>

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:12.400
<b>my older brother!</b>

00:17:15.490 --> 00:17:17.700
<b>You're not going anywhere.</b>

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:21.120
<b>I believe I said we were taking your soul.</b>

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:22.910
<b>Damn it! You again!</b>

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:27.620
<b>Who cares about souls like that,
now, Hana-gumi?</b>

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:30.960
<b>This is the fabled Golem!</b>

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:32.130
<b>I see!</b>

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:35.300
<b>The more I look, the more I appreciate
the excellent workmanship!</b>

00:17:35.380 --> 00:17:36.930
<b>What do you mean?</b>

00:17:37.010 --> 00:17:39.260
<b>The strong one isn't the kid.</b>

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:42.930
<b>It's the Golem that we need.</b>

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:45.180
<b>Damn! Why now?</b>

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:47.270
<b>Oh, my.</b>

00:17:47.350 --> 00:17:50.900
<b>It's been another
nonstop day today, hasn't it?</b>

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:52.650
<b>Don't complain.</b>

00:17:52.730 --> 00:17:55.690
<b>We've landed a whopper to end the day!</b>

00:17:56.650 --> 00:18:00.280
<b>The two children's combined Furyoku is 1,600.</b>

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:04.160
<b>The astounding thing though
is that intermediary's Furyoku.</b>

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:07.290
<b>It's no less than 550,000.</b>

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:09.880
<b>So this is the true power
of Integrated Furyoku.</b>

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:09.880
<b>Furyoku</b>

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:09.880
<b>Furyoku</b>

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:09.880
<b>550,000</b>

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:09.880
<b>550,000</b>

00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:12.500
<b>Integrated Furyoku?</b>

00:18:12.590 --> 00:18:15.170
<b>Oh, have you not heard
of it before, Yoh-sama?</b>

00:18:16.050 --> 00:18:19.340
<b>Ordinarily, Shamans consume their own Furyoku</b>

00:18:19.430 --> 00:18:21.470
<b>to produce Over Souls.</b>

00:18:21.550 --> 00:18:24.430
<b>Naturally, however,
Shamans with little Furyoku</b>

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:27.810
<b>cannot command Spirit Allies
that demand higher figures.</b>

00:18:28.310 --> 00:18:31.230
<b>Integrated Furyoku was developed</b>

00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:33.820
<b>to address that issue.</b>

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:35.730
<b><i>Think of it as a battery.</i></b>

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:39.240
<b><i>If Furyoku can be stored inside,
like a battery, problem solved.</i></b>

00:18:39.740 --> 00:18:43.280
<b>But 550,000 is an insane amount of Furyoku…</b>

00:18:43.370 --> 00:18:44.660
<b>Where does it come from?</b>

00:18:45.410 --> 00:18:48.660
<b>Why don't you find out
straight from the horse's mouth?</b>

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:51.250
<b>Ask the man who possessed his own daughter</b>

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:54.880
<b>to control the Golem,
Professor Camel Muntzer!</b>

00:18:55.590 --> 00:18:57.670
<b>You think we'll lie down and take this?</b>

00:18:59.420 --> 00:19:00.970
<b>Release us, villain!</b>

00:19:01.590 --> 00:19:05.180
<b>The Golem was born
to save our people without land!</b>

00:19:05.260 --> 00:19:06.810
<b>He's a robot!</b>

00:19:07.390 --> 00:19:08.560
<b>You think I'll hand it</b>

00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:11.100
<b>and all its secrets over to you?</b>

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:13.980
<b>Emeth Blast!</b>

00:19:19.530 --> 00:19:20.740
<b>Schwerer!</b>

00:19:23.410 --> 00:19:24.660
<b>What?</b>

00:19:24.740 --> 00:19:25.950
<b>What is this?</b>

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:29.370
<b>Why is Dad possessing Seyram?</b>

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:32.330
<b>This will finish it!</b>

00:19:36.340 --> 00:19:37.670
<b>So small.</b>

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:39.090
<b>Stop, Hao!</b>

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:42.890
<b>I'll fight you.</b>

00:19:43.930 --> 00:19:46.310
<b>You expect me to take you seriously?</b>

00:19:46.390 --> 00:19:47.510
<b>No.</b>

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:51.100
<b>I know I can't beat you,
no matter how hard I try.</b>

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:55.230
<b>But I won't let you harm the Golem!</b>

00:19:56.230 --> 00:19:57.570
<b>You mean it, don't you?</b>

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:00.740
<b>Zang-Ching.</b>

00:20:00.820 --> 00:20:01.990
<b>Okay!</b>

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:05.160
<b>Peyote.</b>

00:20:06.030 --> 00:20:06.910
<b>Way ahead of you.</b>

00:20:08.490 --> 00:20:09.680
<b>Yoh!</b>

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:10.790
<b>Turbine.</b>

00:20:12.710 --> 00:20:19.590
<b>Oh, I see you've used up all
of your wishes for your Djinn for today.</b>

00:20:21.090 --> 00:20:22.470
<b>He looks so sad!</b>

00:20:23.090 --> 00:20:24.890
<b>Do you see now?</b>

00:20:25.510 --> 00:20:27.970
<b>As you are now,
you're not even a match for them,</b>

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:30.100
<b>let alone me.</b>

00:20:31.310 --> 00:20:34.270
<b>You're my precious other half.</b>

00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:38.400
<b>So don't get out of line.</b>

00:20:39.070 --> 00:20:42.320
<b>I'll be going as soon
as I've fed him the Golem.</b>

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:49.910
<b>I'm sorry, Hao.</b>

00:20:49.990 --> 00:20:51.080
<b>Yoh!</b>

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:52.120
<b>I'm cutting you down!</b>

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:55.120
<b>So small.</b>

00:21:02.670 --> 00:21:04.590
<b>Yoh! I'll take care of the Golem!</b>

00:21:04.680 --> 00:21:05.630
<b>Lyserg!</b>

00:21:08.470 --> 00:21:11.970
<b>Easy, there! I wouldn't
take another step if I were you.</b>

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:13.430
<b>Or you'll get frostbitten!</b>

00:21:16.810 --> 00:21:18.610
<b>Are you all right, Yoh?</b>

00:21:18.690 --> 00:21:20.900
<b>Yeah. You saved my ass, Ren.</b>

00:21:20.980 --> 00:21:22.320
<b>And you, Horohoro.</b>

00:21:22.400 --> 00:21:25.030
<b>But why are you here?</b>

00:21:25.110 --> 00:21:26.490
<b>I called them.</b>

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:29.280
<b>What you said played on my mind,</b>

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:31.160
<b>so I followed you.</b>

00:21:31.740 --> 00:21:33.410
<b>What I said?</b>

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:37.080
<b>"You get what you give."</b>

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:41.250
<b>I saw Chocolove get shot
through the heart as well.</b>

00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:44.920
<b>My parents were also killed by Hao,</b>

00:21:45.010 --> 00:21:47.260
<b>so I know all too well how the kid feels.</b>

00:21:47.340 --> 00:21:50.640
<b>That's why I decided
to stand by and let it happen.</b>

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:53.020
<b>Lyserg…</b>

00:21:53.890 --> 00:21:54.810
<b>However…</b>

00:21:55.930 --> 00:21:59.860
<b>However, now I think
I'm starting to understand what you meant.</b>

00:22:00.770 --> 00:22:04.780
<b>So knowing the risks,
I brought everyone here.</b>

00:22:06.150 --> 00:22:07.990
<b>That way we could understand each other.</b>

00:22:08.490 --> 00:22:11.950
<b>Only then can we form
a true bond of friendship.</b>

